&lt;li&gt;Understands the importance of a prepared environment and ends the day by readying the room for the next morning.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ensures Ohana&#39;s Principles are delivered to the highest standard. Mentors and coaches other teachers to deliver Ohana principles.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Complies with Bandwidth&#39;s Code of Conduct, protects the company&#39;s reputation, and prevents legal and regulatory violations. Ensures direct reports understand and comply with these responsibilities.&lt;/li&gt;
