&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What We Are Looking For:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are seeking an innovative and AI-savvy &lt;strong&gt;Internal Applications Engineer&lt;/strong&gt; to help build and maintain the systems that keep Bandwidth&#39;s operations running efficiently. You will design, develop, and deploy automation workflows, API integrations, and AI-powered internal tools, working alongside senior engineers to ship real solutions into production. In this role, you will work across the full spectrum of the team&#39;s stack, from workflow automation and system integrations to data pipelines and user-facing applications.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You&#39;ll Do:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Analyze and automate:&lt;/strong&gt; Identify opportunities for automation within existing processes, leveraging generative AI, workflow orchestration platforms, and conventional software development to design and implement intelligent solutions that reduce manual effort and improve accuracy.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Build internal tooling:&lt;/strong&gt; Develop and maintain user-facing applications for internal teams using React and FastAPI, deployed on the team&#39;s container-based infrastructure, prioritizing reliable behavior and a clean user experience.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Integrate systems&lt;/strong&gt;: Configure and maintain integrations between Bandwidth&#39;s operational platforms (Major CRM Platforms, ServiceNow, and others) using n8n, Windmill, and Python scripts, handling authentication, data transformation, and webhook flows to keep business workflows connected.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Support data pipelines&lt;/strong&gt;: Assist in building and maintaining workflows that land data from operational systems into Snowflake, ensuring reliable data flow for downstream use.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Harness the power of AI:&lt;/strong&gt; Utilize AI platforms and LLM APIs (Anthropic, OpenAI, and others) to develop AI-powered solutions that generate insights, automate responses, and enhance decision-making, using AI-assisted development tools like Claude Code as a core part of your daily workflow.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Develop custom scripts and workflows:&lt;/strong&gt; Write scripts in Python and JavaScript to automate repetitive tasks, integrate APIs, and extend automation capabilities across the team&#39;s stack.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Test and iterate:&lt;/strong&gt; Thoroughly test developed solutions, gather user feedback, and continuously refine and improve implementations based on real-world usage.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Collaborate and communicate:&lt;/strong&gt; Work closely with stakeholders across different departments to gather requirements, present solutions, and ensure successful adoption of new tools and automations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Document and share knowledge:&lt;/strong&gt; Maintain clear and comprehensive documentation of developed solutions, workflows, and best practices to facilitate knowledge sharing and ongoing maintenance.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Data security and privacy:&lt;/strong&gt; Ensure compliance with data security and privacy regulations when handling sensitive information within automated processes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Assist the IT department in troubleshooting and resolving software issues.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Provide technical guidance and support to other team members.&lt;/li&gt;
