&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Education:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bachelor&#39;s degree in Computer Science, Information Technology, or a related field, or equivalent experience.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Experience:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Python and/or JavaScript in a production or project context.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;REST API integration, any platforms or languages.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with workflow automation platforms (e.g., n8n, Windmill, UI Bakery) helpful for maintaining existing systems.&lt;/li&gt;
