&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Education:
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bachelor’s degree (or higher)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Preferred fields of study include Telecommunications, Business, Information Technology, Computer Science, or a related field.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience:
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;2+ years experience in software/telecom support roles&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Knowledge:
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Telecom Operations: Basic Understanding of SMS/MMS Technologies: Familiarity with the fundamentals of SMS and MMS, including common issues and standard industry practices.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Customer Service Skills: Knowledge of customer support principles and techniques, focusing on effective communication and problem-solving.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Introductory Technical Skills: Basic knowledge of SMPP, API, and MM4 protocols, with an ability to follow established procedures for troubleshooting and support.&lt;/li&gt;
