&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Our Hiring Team Mission:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;On the&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;Voice team&lt;/strong&gt;, we build and operate the systems that power reliable voice connectivity across Bandwidth’s network. Our work spans the full lifecycle of voice services — from provisioning and configuration to ongoing management — across multiple downstream systems that sit directly in the path of live customer traffic.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are an engineering led organization with a focus on creating automation that is safe, scalable, and resilient, allowing voice and communications platforms to connect seamlessly to our carrier infrastructure. If you enjoy working at the intersection of application logic and real network infrastructure — writing code that orchestrates external systems, with reliability and serving our customers as the top priority — this is that kind of work.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What We Are Looking For:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are looking for a talented and energetic&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;Software Engineer &lt;/strong&gt;who is motivated to learn, develop, and collaborate within a highly agile environment. We’re seeking a team oriented self-starter with a goal of becoming a technology leader in the coming years.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You own your code and apps fully end-to-end, from design to development to operations and monitoring in production.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You use AI effectively across the full development lifecycle and review AI-generated code with the same rigor as human-written code: security, style, and compliance standards.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You utilize AI to innovate and add customer value.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You&#39;ll Do:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;In voice, &lt;strong&gt;we process billions of calls per month, via a variety of communication channels – empowering customers to communicate reliably, freely and at scale.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You will:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Contribute to solutions from start to finish, collaborating across teams to iteratively ship value.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work with a team of software engineers with experience in distributed microservices and full stack systems.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate closely with product owners to create solutions that deliver the power to communicate.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive innovation within Voice.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You Need:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If you’re our person, you probably look like this:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Applicants should have a minimum of 2+ years of experience designing web services and service-oriented architectures in a modern programming language (Java, C#, or Go).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hands on experience with AI&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;An understanding of IP networking and protocols, HTTP, and REST.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with test automation patterns and frameworks.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You’re familiar with relational and non-relational database systems&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Solid written and verbal communication skills in English.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A 4-year technical degree or equivalent experience.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Bonus Points:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Wow, it’d be really great if also:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Have designed and built AI Agents&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You have experience with AWS or another cloud platform, and you “get” how scalable cloud applications are engineered&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You have worked with Docker containers and Kubernetes&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The Whole Person Promise:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Bandwidth, we’re pretty proud of our corporate culture, which is rooted in our “Whole Person Promise.” We promise all employees that they can have meaningful work AND a full life, and we provide a work environment geared toward enriching your body, mind, and spirit. How do we do that? Well…&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;100% company-paid Medical, Vision, &amp;amp; Dental coverage for you and your family with low deductibles and low out-of-pocket expenses.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;All new hires receive four weeks of PTO.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;PTO Embargo. When you take time off (of any kind!) you’re embargoed from working. Bandmates and managers are not allowed to interrupt your PTO – not even with email.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Additional PTO can be earned throughout the year through volunteer hours and Bandwidth challenges.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;“Mahalo moments” program grants additional time off for life’s most important moments like graduations, buying a first home, getting married, wedding anniversaries (every five years), and the birth of a grandchild.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;90-Minute Workout Lunches and unlimited meetings with our very own nutritionist.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Are you excited about the position and its responsibilities, but not sure if you’re 100% qualified? Do you feel you can work to help us crush the mission? If you answered ‘yes’ to both of these questions, we encourage you to apply! You won’t want to miss the opportunity to be a part of the BAND.&lt;/p&gt;
