&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What We Are Looking For:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The &lt;strong&gt;Sr. IP Network Engineer&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;designs, operates, and continuously improves Bandwidth&#39;s global IP network infrastructure. This role owns critical functions across datacenter fabric, WAN routing, and firewall security — and drives the automation initiatives that keep the network reliable at scale. The ideal candidate brings deep hands-on expertise in VxLAN/EVPN datacenter architectures and Palo Alto firewall platforms, combined with a strong foundation in service provider routing protocols.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You&#39;ll Do:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Design and operate VxLAN/EVPN-based datacenter fabrics across multiple Points of Presence (PoPs), including leaf-spine topology, BGP EVPN control plane, and overlay/underlay integration.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage and maintain Palo Alto firewall infrastructure, including zone-based policy design, Panorama administration, threat prevention, and security rule lifecycle management.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Architect and maintain BGP-based WAN routing across Bandwidth&#39;s backbone network, including iBGP/eBGP policy, route manipulation, and prefix management.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Troubleshoot complex, multi-layer network issues spanning switching, routing, and security infrastructure.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop and maintain network automation tooling — including device provisioning, configuration management, and event-driven remediation — using Python, Ansible, or similar frameworks.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Evaluate emerging network technologies and lead proof-of-concept efforts to drive platform improvements.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate with cross-functional Engineering and Operations teams to deliver network changes and infrastructure projects.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Mentor junior network engineers and provide technical leadership on complex projects.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Participate in on-call rotation and perform scheduled after-hours maintenance as required.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Contribute to network documentation, runbooks, and post-incident reviews (RFOs).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support vendor relationships and assist with hardware procurement evaluation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You Need:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Education:&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bachelor&#39;s degree in Computer Science, Network Engineering, or a related technical field; or equivalent work experience.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience:&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;10+ years of hands-on experience in service provider network infrastructure roles.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrated production experience with VxLAN/EVPN datacenter fabrics (leaf-spine architecture, BGP EVPN control plane).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrated production experience with Palo Alto Networks firewalls, including Panorama and zone-based security policy.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Knowledge:&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Expert-level understanding of BGP (iBGP/eBGP), OSPF, and MPLS in production environments.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong understanding of datacenter networking concepts: VxLAN, EVPN, VPCs, and Spanning Tree.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with Linux operating systems and command-line tooling.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Skills:&amp;nbsp;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proficiency in at least one scripting or programming language (Python preferred) for network automation tasks.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong written and verbal communication skills; ability to produce clear technical documentation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to work independently and lead project work with minimal supervision.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Bonus Points:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Education:
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Industry certifications: CCIE (R&amp;amp;S or Data Center), JNCIE, PCNSE, or equivalent.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience:&amp;nbsp;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with Cisco ASR/NCS (IOS-XR) and/or Juniper MX/SRX platforms.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with ACI, NSX, or other SDN/overlay controller platforms.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Exposure to AI-assisted network operations tooling or observability platforms&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Knowledge:&amp;nbsp;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Expert level datacenter fabric experience&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Skills:&amp;nbsp;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with infrastructure-as-code practices (Ansible, Terraform, or similar).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with network source-of-truth platforms such as NetBox.&lt;/li&gt;
